  this space by: • Domain is work.test / Change or remove these routes before
  deleting the space.", OK; Routed survives. Settings "−": the same alert,
  Routed survives. "−" on Plain: "• Links from Mail • The Default route, for
  links no route matches"; Plain survives. Route removed: "Delete
  "Routed"?" -> Delete, Routed gone.
- Step 4: Undo Add Space -> alert "“Undoable” can’t be deleted ... • Domain is
  undo.test"; Undoable survives; the stacks read undo=Undo Add Space,
